(2752410, 384022, 57202, '<td valign="top">First off, cool crystal ball!  I really like the desaturation and think you selected a very good DOF to help blur out that background.  The placement of Steve in the shot is subtle and suits the challenge well.  Being that he is a nature photographer and the point of the challenge is to try and track him down, I think this photo meets the challenge perfectly.  Well done. :)</td>', 'First off, cool crystal ball!  I really like the desaturation and think you selected a very good DOF to help blur out that background.  The placement of Steve in the shot is subtle and suits the challenge well.  Being that he is a nature photographer and the point of the challenge is to try and track him down, I think this photo meets the challenge perfectly.  Well done. :)', '2006-08-23 12:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752415, 381655, 58608, '<td valign="top">Probably the worst photo O''ve ever seen on here.  If it''s even a photogragh.</td>', 'Probably the worst photo O''ve ever seen on here.  If it''s even a photogragh.', '2006-08-23 12:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752454, 384018, 57202, '<td valign="top">I think the quick-voters may hurt this shot''s score a bit.  However, I really like it. :)  The placement of "dpc" and "stdavidson" are subtle, yet clever.  The composition and DOF are nice, and the colors are nice and bright.  This is definitely an "outside the box" shot - well done. :D</td>', 'I think the quick-voters may hurt this shot''s score a bit.  However, I really like it. :)  The placement of "dpc" and "stdavidson" are subtle, yet clever.  The composition and DOF are nice, and the colors are nice and bright.  This is definitely an "outside the box" shot - well done. :D', '2006-08-23 12:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752472, 383043, 57202, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  However, on a dark monitor (which I''m stuck with at work) it''s pretty much impossible to see Steve''s image.  While voters should be using calibrated monitors, I think the very subtle nature of its placement may sway some voters lower.  Despite that fact though, I think this is a great shot and is very serene.  I think you also could have used a shot like this in the Zen challenge. :)</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  However, on a dark monitor (which I''m stuck with at work) it''s pretty much impossible to see Steve''s image.  While voters should be using calibrated monitors, I think the very subtle nature of its placement may sway some voters lower.  Despite that fact though, I think this is a great shot and is very serene.  I think you also could have used a shot like this in the Zen challenge. :)', '2006-08-23 12:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752484, 384144, 57202, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, but it seems slightly out-of-focus and the lighting seems a bit snapshot-ish.  If you wanted to shoot this particular subject (i.e. the frog), it might have helped if you zoomed out slightly to include the whole frog and also changed your angle so that we can see more of the face.  After doing so, some post-processing could have helped it "pop" a little more.  For example, some Levels adjustments in Photoshop and maybe some dodging and burning could have helped draw the voters attention towards the subject and away from the background.  But again, kudos on creativity though. :)</td>', 'Creative idea, but it seems slightly out-of-focus and the lighting seems a bit snapshot-ish.  If you wanted to shoot this particular subject (i.e. the frog), it might have helped if you zoomed out slightly to include the whole frog and also changed your angle so that we can see more of the face.  After doing so, some post-processing could have helped it "pop" a little more.  For example, some Levels adjustments in Photoshop and maybe some dodging and burning could have helped draw the voters attention towards the subject and away from the background.  But again, kudos on creativity though. :)', '2006-08-23 12:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752490, 383504, 41794, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture but can''t quite figure out how it fits the challenge?</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture but can''t quite figure out how it fits the challenge?', '2006-08-23 12:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752510, 384072, 57202, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I was wondering if someone was going to tie Carmen Sandiego in somehow...  How could you NOT with a challenge title like that? :)  First off, well done on finding someone whom actually looks like he could be Steve.  The composition is very nice, but it''s too bad that you couldn''t capture just the couple and no other people.  The DOF is nice and I like the fact that they are staring out at the horizon.  The lighting seems a bit harsh (common for most mid-day shots) - I think it may have had more visual appeal if this was shot closer to sunrise or sunset.  The harsh light tends to "wash out" the colors a bit.  Possibly some Levels and Saturation adjustments could have helped it "pop" a bit more.  However, I love the creativity of the idea and that you were able to capture a nice image in such harsh lighting conditions.</td>', 'LOL!  I was wondering if someone was going to tie Carmen Sandiego in somehow...  How could you NOT with a challenge title like that? :)  First off, well done on finding someone whom actually looks like he could be Steve.  The composition is very nice, but it''s too bad that you couldn''t capture just the couple and no other people.  The DOF is nice and I like the fact that they are staring out at the horizon.  The lighting seems a bit harsh (common for most mid-day shots) - I think it may have had more visual appeal if this was shot closer to sunrise or sunset.  The harsh light tends to "wash out" the colors a bit.  Possibly some Levels and Saturation adjustments could have helped it "pop" a bit more.  However, I love the creativity of the idea and that you were able to capture a nice image in such harsh lighting conditions.', '2006-08-23 12:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752511, 383837, 34659, '<td valign="top">Ya know, I''m having trouble connecting this to the challenge, but it is a breathtaking shot.  I have to add it to my Favorites.</td>', 'Ya know, I''m having trouble connecting this to the challenge, but it is a breathtaking shot.  I have to add it to my Favorites.', '2006-08-23 12:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752553, 382732, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like the duotones in this shot. :)  The objects perfectly convey the search for Steve and are arranged to form a pleasing composition.  The lighting is very nice and the sharp focus provides lots of detail.  The only thing I could suggest to improve upon this would have been to remove the object on the right side of the frame (just above the helmet), as it''s only partially in the frame and we can''t really tell what it is.  Absolutely wonderful shot though. :D</td>', 'I really like the duotones in this shot. :)  The objects perfectly convey the search for Steve and are arranged to form a pleasing composition.  The lighting is very nice and the sharp focus provides lots of detail.  The only thing I could suggest to improve upon this would have been to remove the object on the right side of the frame (just above the helmet), as it''s only partially in the frame and we can''t really tell what it is.  Absolutely wonderful shot though. :D', '2006-08-23 13:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752560, 383306, 57202, '<td valign="top">LOL!  So THAT''S where he was all along! :)  Excellent composition, rich colors, and lots of creativity.  Good job!</td>', 'LOL!  So THAT''S where he was all along! :)  Excellent composition, rich colors, and lots of creativity.  Good job!', '2006-08-23 13:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752571, 382458, 57202, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and a good photo, but I instantly found myself searching for Steve Davidson''s likeness in the frame.  To me, the challenge was intended to convey the search for or discovery of stdavidson.  Like I said - good shot, but it could have met the challenge a little better in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice composition and a good photo, but I instantly found myself searching for Steve Davidson''s likeness in the frame.  To me, the challenge was intended to convey the search for or discovery of stdavidson.  Like I said - good shot, but it could have met the challenge a little better in my opinion.', '2006-08-23 13:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752715, 383596, 57202, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a fisheye lens. :)  Great DOF, sharp focus, and AWESOME rich colors!</td>', 'Nice use of a fisheye lens. :)  Great DOF, sharp focus, and AWESOME rich colors!', '2006-08-23 13:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752728, 382402, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like how the footprints lead you into the scene. :)  However, the top-right corner of the frame looks overly-burnt to me.  Nice tones in the sand, but I think the sky could have benefited from a hue/saturation adjustment or possibly a complete desaturation of the sky.  Great concept though. :D</td>', 'I really like how the footprints lead you into the scene. :)  However, the top-right corner of the frame looks overly-burnt to me.  Nice tones in the sand, but I think the sky could have benefited from a hue/saturation adjustment or possibly a complete desaturation of the sky.  Great concept though. :D', '2006-08-23 13:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752745, 382622, 57202, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL shot.  Serene, calm, great use of duotones.  Excellent composition, and the title is perfect for this photo.  However, how does this relate to the search for Steve? ;)</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL shot.  Serene, calm, great use of duotones.  Excellent composition, and the title is perfect for this photo.  However, how does this relate to the search for Steve? ;)', '2006-08-23 13:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752759, 383616, 57202, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors!  The sky is amazing in this shot. :)  This is the type of shot that makes me happy that wide-angle lenses were developed. :D</td>', 'Awesome colors!  The sky is amazing in this shot. :)  This is the type of shot that makes me happy that wide-angle lenses were developed. :D', '2006-08-23 13:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752778, 383343, 57202, '<td valign="top">Whoa!!!  What a KILLER shot! :)  The haze in the air and the silhouette by the fence make this truly look like a vortex.  The star-like light on the left almost makes the "vortex" appear to be in the middle of a solar system somewhere. :)  Okay, well technically it is, but you know what I mean. :D</td>', 'Whoa!!!  What a KILLER shot! :)  The haze in the air and the silhouette by the fence make this truly look like a vortex.  The star-like light on the left almost makes the "vortex" appear to be in the middle of a solar system somewhere. :)  Okay, well technically it is, but you know what I mean. :D', '2006-08-23 13:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752780, 382598, 57202, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. :)  The title couldn''t be more fitting for this photo.  Nice blues in the sky and greens in the grass and trees.  And climbing to the top of that hill for this shot shows some major dedication as well. :D  Great job!</td>', 'Awesome shot. :)  The title couldn''t be more fitting for this photo.  Nice blues in the sky and greens in the grass and trees.  And climbing to the top of that hill for this shot shows some major dedication as well. :D  Great job!', '2006-08-23 13:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752784, 383802, 57202, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit of a stretch for the challenge description, but is such a great shot I''m not sure it matters. :)  The tones in the image are cool and calming, and the flowing water give a feeling of serenity.</td>', 'It''s a bit of a stretch for the challenge description, but is such a great shot I''m not sure it matters. :)  The tones in the image are cool and calming, and the flowing water give a feeling of serenity.', '2006-08-23 14:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752787, 384121, 57202, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I like the concept. :)  Nice contrast between the nice blue sky and white clouds.</td>', 'LOL!  I like the concept. :)  Nice contrast between the nice blue sky and white clouds.', '2006-08-23 14:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752807, 383431, 57202, '<td valign="top">Hey!  No fair! ;)  I was wondering if one of the Arizonians was going to manage to get Steve for the shot. :)  I like the concept of the shot and think it is very fitting of this challenge, as I imagine that spending that time wandering through the desert must have really put things in perspective for Steve.  Sometimes we all just need a reminder to take a deep breath and appreciate what we have.</td>', 'Hey!  No fair! ;)  I was wondering if one of the Arizonians was going to manage to get Steve for the shot. :)  I like the concept of the shot and think it is very fitting of this challenge, as I imagine that spending that time wandering through the desert must have really put things in perspective for Steve.  Sometimes we all just need a reminder to take a deep breath and appreciate what we have.', '2006-08-23 14:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
