(2756974, 383738, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Very nice tone and texture and you''ve gotten an appropriate message across without being tricky with it.  Well done.<br/> <br/>Did you pull something off that right shutter (lower left)?  The wood is weathered most everywhere else but there.  ;^)</td>', 'Great shot.  Very nice tone and texture and you''ve gotten an appropriate message across without being tricky with it.  Well done. Did you pull something off that right shutter (lower left)?  The wood is weathered most everywhere else but there.  ;^)', '2006-08-24 14:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
