(2759855, 383961, 27399, '<td valign="top">Great image!  I think it would have been better as a true b/w.  I think you lose something with this tint . . . but great shot!</td>', 'Great image!  I think it would have been better as a true b/w.  I think you lose something with this tint . . . but great shot!', '2006-08-25 14:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759863, 383913, 27399, '<td valign="top">awesome idea and great delivery!  the image as a whole works great, perhaps if there were other leaves to the right to fill in for the open space it might make the image even more "incognito" since he is clearly not over in that area of the frame.  good work.</td>', 'awesome idea and great delivery!  the image as a whole works great, perhaps if there were other leaves to the right to fill in for the open space it might make the image even more "incognito" since he is clearly not over in that area of the frame.  good work.', '2006-08-25 14:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759868, 384068, 27399, '<td valign="top">brilliant idea, great delivery.</td>', 'brilliant idea, great delivery.', '2006-08-25 14:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759870, 383738, 27399, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  framing, exposure, colors all are great.  only thing is why not flip it horizontally so that "help me" read correctly?</td>', 'nice shot.  framing, exposure, colors all are great.  only thing is why not flip it horizontally so that "help me" read correctly?', '2006-08-25 14:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
