(2760236, 382894, 43565, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I am not totally sure what you are saying here, and I find the two blow up dolls distracting--especially the green one.</td>', 'Sorry, but I am not totally sure what you are saying here, and I find the two blow up dolls distracting--especially the green one.', '2006-08-25 17:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
