(2762002, 383837, 9111, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t fit the challenge... but OMG this is gorgeous   10</td>', 'This doesn''t fit the challenge... but OMG this is gorgeous   10', '2006-08-26 09:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762021, 383133, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love the light on the road and the deep focus. The road and center line are my favorite part of this image, but the sun is also quite well done. Cool that you got the "Steve" biker in there, too!</td>', 'Beautiful! I love the light on the road and the deep focus. The road and center line are my favorite part of this image, but the sun is also quite well done. Cool that you got the "Steve" biker in there, too!', '2006-08-26 09:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762023, 383678, 31133, '<td valign="top">Great job meeting the challenge! Focus is excellent, especially around Mesa. The finger could be a bit sharper, but it''s good that it''s there - it contributes a lot to the image in my opinion. The compass is a nice touch.</td>', 'Great job meeting the challenge! Focus is excellent, especially around Mesa. The finger could be a bit sharper, but it''s good that it''s there - it contributes a lot to the image in my opinion. The compass is a nice touch.', '2006-08-26 09:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762026, 384143, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness of this. Looks like there''s a ray of sun coming out of the fog just to point out "Steve". Gorgeous location, too.</td>', 'I like the darkness of this. Looks like there''s a ray of sun coming out of the fog just to point out "Steve". Gorgeous location, too.', '2006-08-26 09:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762036, 381765, 31133, '<td valign="top">Heh, awesome brush! This is a beatiful image, too - in every way.</td>', 'Heh, awesome brush! This is a beatiful image, too - in every way.', '2006-08-26 09:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762040, 383913, 31133, '<td valign="top">GREAT!! The eye is perfect. For the rest of the photo: Wonderful detail and gorgeous tones. I''d love to see the lower part of the leaf as sharp as the middle part, but it''s not too distracting, so consider that a tiny nit, please.  I''m giving you an 8.</td>', 'GREAT!! The eye is perfect. For the rest of the photo: Wonderful detail and gorgeous tones. I''d love to see the lower part of the leaf as sharp as the middle part, but it''s not too distracting, so consider that a tiny nit, please.  I''m giving you an 8.', '2006-08-26 09:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762042, 383461, 31133, '<td valign="top">Tack sharp and nice compostition. I like the empty space of the grass in the foreground. The shapes of those three rounded bushes add some nice interest to the image. The only nitpick is it seems a bit overexposed. But very nice job overall and appealing tones.</td>', 'Tack sharp and nice compostition. I like the empty space of the grass in the foreground. The shapes of those three rounded bushes add some nice interest to the image. The only nitpick is it seems a bit overexposed. But very nice job overall and appealing tones.', '2006-08-26 09:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762046, 383938, 31133, '<td valign="top">I try hard not to comment on frame choices unless I find them really distracting. Unfortunately, I find this frame choice distracting. Sorry. I do think it''s a clever idea with the ghost going into the corn field and I feel you met the challenge very well. Also nice job on the sky.</td>', 'I try hard not to comment on frame choices unless I find them really distracting. Unfortunately, I find this frame choice distracting. Sorry. I do think it''s a clever idea with the ghost going into the corn field and I feel you met the challenge very well. Also nice job on the sky.', '2006-08-26 09:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762114, 382732, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think there''s a little too much in this image. The helmet thing in the lower right distracts me quite a bit, because I can''t really figure out what it is. Likewise, there''s some kind of a cover attached to the compass that draws my eye away from the map. I think the map is the main subject, but all the other objects in the frame make me unsure. I do like the tones and clarity. I also like your idea.</td>', 'I think there''s a little too much in this image. The helmet thing in the lower right distracts me quite a bit, because I can''t really figure out what it is. Likewise, there''s some kind of a cover attached to the compass that draws my eye away from the map. I think the map is the main subject, but all the other objects in the frame make me unsure. I do like the tones and clarity. I also like your idea.', '2006-08-26 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762115, 382660, 31133, '<td valign="top">Cute :-) That''s a sweet little suit. Foreground could be a bit sharper, but the composition is so good that my eye is drawn right to the subject, which is in clear focus.</td>', 'Cute :-) That''s a sweet little suit. Foreground could be a bit sharper, but the composition is so good that my eye is drawn right to the subject, which is in clear focus.', '2006-08-26 10:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762118, 383996, 31133, '<td valign="top">So empty in such an appealing way... There''s a bit of detail missing in the ground, I think, but that''s a nit. Mostly, I think this is a very, very nice image. The mountains and the figure hiking are the best parts, in my opinion.</td>', 'So empty in such an appealing way... There''s a bit of detail missing in the ground, I think, but that''s a nit. Mostly, I think this is a very, very nice image. The mountains and the figure hiking are the best parts, in my opinion.', '2006-08-26 10:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762124, 383973, 31133, '<td valign="top">Even though you did a good job with the brush (and I wish I knew how to do that so well!), I think I''d like this better without Steve - it would still work, thanks to your title. I have nothing against Steve brushes in this challenge. It''s just that I think it looks a little too fakey - even though I understand that''s what you were going for. I love the image otherwise! It''s a good comp and nice bokeh to boot :-)</td>', 'Even though you did a good job with the brush (and I wish I knew how to do that so well!), I think I''d like this better without Steve - it would still work, thanks to your title. I have nothing against Steve brushes in this challenge. It''s just that I think it looks a little too fakey - even though I understand that''s what you were going for. I love the image otherwise! It''s a good comp and nice bokeh to boot :-)', '2006-08-26 10:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762125, 383113, 42615, '<td valign="top">very good!!  glad to see you were validated! I will look forward to seeing how you did it.</td>', 'very good!!  glad to see you were validated! I will look forward to seeing how you did it.', '2006-08-26 10:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762128, 383738, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The "help me" is such a subtle element, it took me by surprise when I saw it.</td>', 'Beautiful! The "help me" is such a subtle element, it took me by surprise when I saw it.', '2006-08-26 10:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762129, 384060, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice light. I''d like to see a tiny bit more detail in the shadows, but maybe that would destroy the good light effect on the stones...</td>', 'Nice light. I''d like to see a tiny bit more detail in the shadows, but maybe that would destroy the good light effect on the stones...', '2006-08-26 10:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762134, 384174, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think I recognize the marsh. Bear_music?</td>', 'I think I recognize the marsh. Bear_music?', '2006-08-26 10:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762139, 383258, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is the very best one with Steve brushes, if that is a brush effect in the sky. Either way, it''s one of my favorites so far, and that''s saying a lot since I have been voting the more natural pictures higher in this challenge. But this just draws me right in. The graduations in the sky and the small clouds are such a perfect backdrop for the figure with the umbrella. The road looks too smooth and painted for my taste, but otherwise, there''s not a critical thing I can say. 9</td>', 'This is the very best one with Steve brushes, if that is a brush effect in the sky. Either way, it''s one of my favorites so far, and that''s saying a lot since I have been voting the more natural pictures higher in this challenge. But this just draws me right in. The graduations in the sky and the small clouds are such a perfect backdrop for the figure with the umbrella. The road looks too smooth and painted for my taste, but otherwise, there''s not a critical thing I can say. 9', '2006-08-26 10:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762143, 381765, 42615, '<td valign="top">neat, er....cool.  Had to look, thought it was ''just'' a great landscape</td>', 'neat, er....cool.  Had to look, thought it was ''just'' a great landscape', '2006-08-26 10:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762144, 384022, 42615, '<td valign="top">very clever concept</td>', 'very clever concept', '2006-08-26 10:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762146, 383616, 31133, '<td valign="top">The sky, beach, and water have gorgeous colors and I like the processing there a lot. For my taste, the green behind the people is way too saturated though. The composition is classic, though - in a very appealing way. The framing with the grass in foreground is a sweet bonus for me.</td>', 'The sky, beach, and water have gorgeous colors and I like the processing there a lot. For my taste, the green behind the people is way too saturated though. The composition is classic, though - in a very appealing way. The framing with the grass in foreground is a sweet bonus for me.', '2006-08-26 10:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762152, 383921, 31133, '<td valign="top">What an incredibly spot-on entry for this challenge! It''s not only Steve''s area   (I think), but it''s just a plainly beautiful image. The sky and the light are wonderful. Very good job and my only 10 so far.</td>', 'What an incredibly spot-on entry for this challenge! It''s not only Steve''s area   (I think), but it''s just a plainly beautiful image. The sky and the light are wonderful. Very good job and my only 10 so far.', '2006-08-26 10:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762154, 383129, 42615, '<td valign="top">nice picture but I still don''t see Steve</td>', 'nice picture but I still don''t see Steve', '2006-08-26 10:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762156, 384184, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like the play of colors as well, kind of wish there was a bit more of the yellowy orange in it though.  The title is cute, never saw that movie.. wonder if its worth it.  Anyway, a few nitpicks:  Cutting off part of the feet, slight softness in the horizon.. and that''s about it.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like the play of colors as well, kind of wish there was a bit more of the yellowy orange in it though.  The title is cute, never saw that movie.. wonder if its worth it.  Anyway, a few nitpicks:  Cutting off part of the feet, slight softness in the horizon.. and that''s about it.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-26 10:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762158, 384055, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. The tones are wonderful. I am reducing my score by a point because of the slightly out of focus cactus on the left that keeps stealing my concentration, but otherwise, this is pretty near perfect. I like the b&amp;w very much.</td>', 'This is really nice. The tones are wonderful. I am reducing my score by a point because of the slightly out of focus cactus on the left that keeps stealing my concentration, but otherwise, this is pretty near perfect. I like the b&w very much.', '2006-08-26 10:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762161, 384121, 31133, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2006-08-26 10:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762162, 383314, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too much with the cat brush for my taste. Very cute cat, however :-)</td>', 'It''s a little too much with the cat brush for my taste. Very cute cat, however :-)', '2006-08-26 10:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762163, 384121, 11923, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Took me awhile but I finally see him!  Definitely got me invested in the image, though only long enough to find the face.  The cloud formations are nice which adds interest.  I like the richness of the blue and there is some nice form deliniation in the cloud shapes.  I like the idea behind the addition of steve''s face, but I do wish that the cloud shape was retained.. as in the bumps and crevices were still evident so it looked as if the face was form-fitting rather than blotting out.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Ha!  Took me awhile but I finally see him!  Definitely got me invested in the image, though only long enough to find the face.  The cloud formations are nice which adds interest.  I like the richness of the blue and there is some nice form deliniation in the cloud shapes.  I like the idea behind the addition of steve''s face, but I do wish that the cloud shape was retained.. as in the bumps and crevices were still evident so it looked as if the face was form-fitting rather than blotting out.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-26 10:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762164, 381434, 42615, '<td valign="top">funny!!</td>', 'funny!!', '2006-08-26 10:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762165, 383837, 42615, '<td valign="top">unless I''m missing it, you are saying steve is an OWL?  Fantastic photo though</td>', 'unless I''m missing it, you are saying steve is an OWL?  Fantastic photo though', '2006-08-26 10:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762166, 382894, 11923, '<td valign="top">Hm.. not sure about this photo.  Its an interesting glimpse into some sort of social event, odd stuff going on there!  But beyond that initial, whattheheck??, my eyes have nothing in particular it wishes to linger on.  The control of the ambient light is good and the photo has some good focus and clarity for the most part.  I think this shot is good for the challenge (he could be anywhere in that crowd) but outside of that arena I don''t find anything to draw me in.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Hm.. not sure about this photo.  Its an interesting glimpse into some sort of social event, odd stuff going on there!  But beyond that initial, whattheheck??, my eyes have nothing in particular it wishes to linger on.  The control of the ambient light is good and the photo has some good focus and clarity for the most part.  I think this shot is good for the challenge (he could be anywhere in that crowd) but outside of that arena I don''t find anything to draw me in.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-26 10:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762167, 382763, 31133, '<td valign="top">Is this a lens baby or is the blur on the edges some special effect in photoshop? Either way, I find it very appealing, especially on the left-hand side. For me, there might be even more impact if the smoke house were more to the right instead of dead center in the frame. I''m enjoying the b&amp;w and reasonably low contrast a lot.</td>', 'Is this a lens baby or is the blur on the edges some special effect in photoshop? Either way, I find it very appealing, especially on the left-hand side. For me, there might be even more impact if the smoke house were more to the right instead of dead center in the frame. I''m enjoying the b&w and reasonably low contrast a lot.', '2006-08-26 10:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762172, 383970, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower, funny figure.  I like the color here, the lighting is nice as well, though I wish the image was just a bit sharper over all.  The little man is cute and definitely grabs my attention.  I don''t think it enhances the photo in general at all but it does go with the whimsical side of this challenge.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Lovely flower, funny figure.  I like the color here, the lighting is nice as well, though I wish the image was just a bit sharper over all.  The little man is cute and definitely grabs my attention.  I don''t think it enhances the photo in general at all but it does go with the whimsical side of this challenge.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-26 10:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762178, 384091, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is now my favorite so far. Love, love, love the portrait hanging on the wall! The blues and spooky shadows are a wonderful bonus. Congratulations on a truly a great entry.</td>', 'This is now my favorite so far. Love, love, love the portrait hanging on the wall! The blues and spooky shadows are a wonderful bonus. Congratulations on a truly a great entry.', '2006-08-26 10:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762180, 383265, 31133, '<td valign="top">There''s a pink tint in the road and buildings on my monitor. Also might be some artifacts, or else I''m wrong :-) It''s a attractive cityscape composition, though.</td>', 'There''s a pink tint in the road and buildings on my monitor. Also might be some artifacts, or else I''m wrong :-) It''s a attractive cityscape composition, though.', '2006-08-26 10:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762186, 384090, 31133, '<td valign="top">The desaturation really detracts from the image for me. I get the point, but I think your composition and the word gold on one of the beers would''ve been sufficient and good. The composition, colors (but not the circle part), and the idea are are quite nice - so I don''t mean to rake you over the coals regarding the desat thing. It was just that that was all I noticed in the beginning. Now, after spending some time with this image, I''m getting thirsty!</td>', 'The desaturation really detracts from the image for me. I get the point, but I think your composition and the word gold on one of the beers would''ve been sufficient and good. The composition, colors (but not the circle part), and the idea are are quite nice - so I don''t mean to rake you over the coals regarding the desat thing. It was just that that was all I noticed in the beginning. Now, after spending some time with this image, I''m getting thirsty!', '2006-08-26 11:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762189, 383910, 31133, '<td valign="top">Really, really cool effect with the fisheye (and I am jealous of that lens!). I love the guy in the background, too. It would be a serious ''wow'' image for me if the sky weren''t blown out, or if the sky were somehow toned down. The red lines in the staircase are such an effective way to bring the eye up along the railing to the silhouette,</td>', 'Really, really cool effect with the fisheye (and I am jealous of that lens!). I love the guy in the background, too. It would be a serious ''wow'' image for me if the sky weren''t blown out, or if the sky were somehow toned down. The red lines in the staircase are such an effective way to bring the eye up along the railing to the silhouette,', '2006-08-26 11:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762190, 384184, 31133, '<td valign="top">Great title! I like this a lot (the picture, not just the title :-)</td>', 'Great title! I like this a lot (the picture, not just the title :-)', '2006-08-26 11:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762191, 383389, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. A new favorite!</td>', 'Beautiful. A new favorite!', '2006-08-26 11:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762197, 382424, 31133, '<td valign="top">For me the composition and setting are wonderful. The only distraction for me is that on my monitor, there''s a bit too much of a yellow cast.</td>', 'For me the composition and setting are wonderful. The only distraction for me is that on my monitor, there''s a bit too much of a yellow cast.', '2006-08-26 11:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762289, 383236, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Intriguing and beautiful.</td>', 'I like it.  Intriguing and beautiful.', '2006-08-26 12:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762326, 384131, 59029, '<td valign="top">Twisted but I love it! an 8!</td>', 'Twisted but I love it! an 8!', '2006-08-26 13:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762330, 383452, 59029, '<td valign="top">freaky...how''d you do it?</td>', 'freaky...how''d you do it?', '2006-08-26 13:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762356, 384091, 53548, '<td valign="top">Haha. This is great. You also see the picture of him on the wall there? Obsessed by a photographer :)</td>', 'Haha. This is great. You also see the picture of him on the wall there? Obsessed by a photographer :)', '2006-08-26 13:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2762359, 383358, 53548, '<td valign="top">Great colors on the sky. Very nice silhouettes</td>', 'Great colors on the sky. Very nice silhouettes', '2006-08-26 13:27:27.000000', NULL, 1);
