(2763159, 383973, 5792, '<td valign="top">Creative and appropriately for the challenge. You did a very good job ncliding the image in the sock. Good clothesline perspective and soft focused background works well. The sepia image in the sock fits perfectly. Nice bokeh.<br/> Though I was able to wash my socks while missing they were REALLY rank and not nearly as nice looking as the ones you captured here. The last place I would want to be is inside them. :) Makes a great picture, though. - Steve</td>', 'Creative and appropriately for the challenge. You did a very good job ncliding the image in the sock. Good clothesline perspective and soft focused background works well. The sepia image in the sock fits perfectly. Nice bokeh. Though I was able to wash my socks while missing they were REALLY rank and not nearly as nice looking as the ones you captured here. The last place I would want to be is inside them. :) Makes a great picture, though. - Steve', '2006-08-26 20:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2763163, 383924, 24642, '<td valign="top">Clever idea caveman.</td>', 'Clever idea caveman.', '2006-08-26 20:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
