(2769121, 384131, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is fantastic, just a bit strange....but really well done and quite funny.</td>', 'That is fantastic, just a bit strange....but really well done and quite funny.', '2006-08-28 22:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2769134, 383343, 10818, '<td valign="top">Well thats never good.  Great shot, nice motion.</td>', 'Well thats never good.  Great shot, nice motion.', '2006-08-28 22:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2769300, 382622, 34192, '<td valign="top">beautiful black and white tones regardless of the challenge.  Excellent capture and conversion.</td>', 'beautiful black and white tones regardless of the challenge.  Excellent capture and conversion.', '2006-08-28 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2769301, 383343, 34192, '<td valign="top">something very jarring about this photo - but in a good way, in a sense.  It really sucks you in (no pun intended).  The bright and shiny colors become garish and are at odds with the emotion felt (carnival!  yay!).  And the spin of the ride only adds to the tension.  Somehow, I believe, this carnival ride is one from hell.  Maybe its due to the shadow of something being ''sucked in.''  I think the crop is a little off on the left but I wasn''t there so what do I know.  Very intriguing image to say the least.  Somehow, I could sit here for a while and ponder this, but I must move on...</td>', 'something very jarring about this photo - but in a good way, in a sense.  It really sucks you in (no pun intended).  The bright and shiny colors become garish and are at odds with the emotion felt (carnival!  yay!).  And the spin of the ride only adds to the tension.  Somehow, I believe, this carnival ride is one from hell.  Maybe its due to the shadow of something being ''sucked in.''  I think the crop is a little off on the left but I wasn''t there so what do I know.  Very intriguing image to say the least.  Somehow, I could sit here for a while and ponder this, but I must move on...', '2006-08-28 23:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2769345, 383924, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is just an awesome shot.  I love the colors and the caveman.<br/> <br/>Excellent, really well done !</td>', 'That is just an awesome shot.  I love the colors and the caveman. Excellent, really well done !', '2006-08-28 23:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
