(2770336, 384143, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, if you ever get the chance to redo it I would wanna encourage you to try taking it with a slightly longer shutter to have the runner motion blurred, would have been perfect for this challenge.  7 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot, if you ever get the chance to redo it I would wanna encourage you to try taking it with a slightly longer shutter to have the runner motion blurred, would have been perfect for this challenge.  7 from me.', '2006-08-29 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770338, 383357, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, love the composition and look of the water, 8 from me.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, love the composition and look of the water, 8 from me.', '2006-08-29 12:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770344, 383938, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I normally try to ignore frames but this one is utterly horrible, mainly in the sense that it does nothing but pull my eye toward the edges of the photo and I can´t really appreciate what looks like a good photo.  I did try though and I really like this shot, I really dig the shape or outlines of a person there, really cool and I still voted this shot a 8 despite the frame, who knows what I would have given it had you not used it.</td>', 'Sorry, I normally try to ignore frames but this one is utterly horrible, mainly in the sense that it does nothing but pull my eye toward the edges of the photo and I can´t really appreciate what looks like a good photo.  I did try though and I really like this shot, I really dig the shape or outlines of a person there, really cool and I still voted this shot a 8 despite the frame, who knows what I would have given it had you not used it.', '2006-08-29 12:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770349, 384144, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, voted this shot a 3, mainly because of the poor image quality.  In case you want me to be more specific, I mean the blurriness/lack of contrast and washed out colors of the shot and also the exposure, it would have looked so much cooler had you used about 1/3 or 1/2 less exposure, bringing out the colors in this statue or whatever it is.  Not really fond of the angle this is shot from either, think I would have liked it better if you had gotten down to the same level of the statue.  Sorry for the rant, I just figured you at least deserved an explanation for the low vote.</td>', 'Sorry, voted this shot a 3, mainly because of the poor image quality.  In case you want me to be more specific, I mean the blurriness/lack of contrast and washed out colors of the shot and also the exposure, it would have looked so much cooler had you used about 1/3 or 1/2 less exposure, bringing out the colors in this statue or whatever it is.  Not really fond of the angle this is shot from either, think I would have liked it better if you had gotten down to the same level of the statue.  Sorry for the rant, I just figured you at least deserved an explanation for the low vote.', '2006-08-29 12:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770352, 384195, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, I am slowly getting tired of all these hand shots and things going on between or on them (the hands that is) but this is very well done technically speaking so I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, I am slowly getting tired of all these hand shots and things going on between or on them (the hands that is) but this is very well done technically speaking so I gave it an 8.', '2006-08-29 12:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770363, 383461, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, somewhat unusual composition and that is why I like it, didn´t notice the guy at first.  Still think I would have liked it even better if you had aimed your camera slightly higher, having less grass and more treetops but still good enough for a 7 from me and I am picky.</td>', 'Nice shot, somewhat unusual composition and that is why I like it, didn´t notice the guy at first.  Still think I would have liked it even better if you had aimed your camera slightly higher, having less grass and more treetops but still good enough for a 7 from me and I am picky.', '2006-08-29 12:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770366, 384023, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, like the humor here :)  Think the shot is a bit flat, for my tastes anyway and I would have voted higher if it were brighter and more contrast.  6 from me.</td>', 'Haha, like the humor here :)  Think the shot is a bit flat, for my tastes anyway and I would have voted higher if it were brighter and more contrast.  6 from me.', '2006-08-29 12:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
