(2774055, 384068, 714, '<td valign="top">Yeah yeah... I know it is blurry..I really wanted to enter this challenge and didn''t get it going till the last day. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/ashamed.gif'', strrpos(''//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/ashamed.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/ashamed.gif"/> The focus was more towards the back and trying to get it just right was so hard considering the lighting I had to use to prevent reflection on the glass.  I learned a ton for sure.  Thanks all!  <br/> <br/>(hug) steve!</td>', 'Yeah yeah... I know it is blurry..I really wanted to enter this challenge and didn''t get it going till the last day.  The focus was more towards the back and trying to get it just right was so hard considering the lighting I had to use to prevent reflection on the glass.  I learned a ton for sure.  Thanks all!   (hug) steve!', '2006-08-30 10:33:13.000000', NULL, 0),
