(2780706, 384068, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I thought about doing something like this, but didn''t take the time.  You did a great job with it.  I like the very subdued lighting - it suits the mood perfectly.  Even the blur adds to it, IMO. It gives a sense of the hands moving about the crystal ball instead of just a staged "Hold it" shot.</td>', 'This is great!  I thought about doing something like this, but didn''t take the time.  You did a great job with it.  I like the very subdued lighting - it suits the mood perfectly.  Even the blur adds to it, IMO. It gives a sense of the hands moving about the crystal ball instead of just a staged "Hold it" shot.', '2006-09-01 00:45:48.000000', NULL, 0),
