(2786085, 382732, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice work with the tones.  The medical bag at the top makes the picture a little top-heavy to me, but I do like the idea and it''s well executed - great clarity of the map and the objects.</td>', 'Nice work with the tones.  The medical bag at the top makes the picture a little top-heavy to me, but I do like the idea and it''s well executed - great clarity of the map and the objects.', '2006-09-01 23:14:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2786113, 383036, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  But it looks like he''s missing an arm.  I like the silhouette idea and the sky is gorgeous behind him.  Heh!  Just read Steve''s comment - what a hoot!  And I agree that a vertical-ish crop cutting off the tree on the left would look nice.  Nice interpretation of this challenge!</td>', 'Cool shot!  But it looks like he''s missing an arm.  I like the silhouette idea and the sky is gorgeous behind him.  Heh!  Just read Steve''s comment - what a hoot!  And I agree that a vertical-ish crop cutting off the tree on the left would look nice.  Nice interpretation of this challenge!', '2006-09-01 23:26:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2786147, 381765, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I normally don''t like the IR shots. I don''t know why except maybe they just don''t feel natural. With that in mind, I''ll let you know that I gave you an 8 in voting because it was original. I actually almost missed the face at the bottom (and that would have dropped you down), but lucky you, I caught it!</td>', 'Trading post...  I normally don''t like the IR shots. I don''t know why except maybe they just don''t feel natural. With that in mind, I''ll let you know that I gave you an 8 in voting because it was original. I actually almost missed the face at the bottom (and that would have dropped you down), but lucky you, I caught it!', '2006-09-01 23:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2786158, 381765, 30982, '<td valign="top">You guys are really having fun with the IR stuff, aren''t you?  Still not my cup of tea, but I do like this - looks a lot like where Aimee took the camera self-portrait shot.  The location does seem to lend itself well to IR.  Love the novel, by the way.  :-)  Like Steve in the corner, but don''t like the "blue" water from the fountain - is there a way to legally not make that part blue?</td>', 'You guys are really having fun with the IR stuff, aren''t you?  Still not my cup of tea, but I do like this - looks a lot like where Aimee took the camera self-portrait shot.  The location does seem to lend itself well to IR.  Love the novel, by the way.  :-)  Like Steve in the corner, but don''t like the "blue" water from the fountain - is there a way to legally not make that part blue?', '2006-09-01 23:47:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2786345, 384195, 64901, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely photo whichever way it was made, don''t get me wrong, but can I just clarify - did you take one photo which had all these elements on the one photo and manipulate the images within the photo?  or did you take 3 photos and them montage them together?  What did you mean when you said 3 exposures?  That would normally mean 3 different photos each with a different exposure.</td>', 'It''s a lovely photo whichever way it was made, don''t get me wrong, but can I just clarify - did you take one photo which had all these elements on the one photo and manipulate the images within the photo?  or did you take 3 photos and them montage them together?  What did you mean when you said 3 exposures?  That would normally mean 3 different photos each with a different exposure.', '2006-09-02 00:54:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2790194, 383738, 32997, '<td valign="top">intimidating and wonderfully processed..well done...</td>', 'intimidating and wonderfully processed..well done...', '2006-09-02 22:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
